#: ../../source/evaluation/efficiency.md:1 32e3ba3151d945178a8f2fe62b62dfa9
msgid "效率评测"
msgstr "Efficiency Benchmarking"

#: ../../source/evaluation/efficiency.md:3 4fc4bf84d6a94dbab9078875f24d57ef
msgid ""
"本指南介绍如何使用 UniKT "
"的能效评测工具（`efficiency.py`）对知识追踪模型在目标硬件上的推理延迟、吞吐量、训练步耗时、显存峰值占用以及理论计算量进行标准化基准测试，并评估"
" PyTorch 2.0+ `torch.compile` 的加速表现。"
msgstr ""
"This guide details how to benchmark inference latency, throughput, "
"training step duration, peak GPU memory allocation, and theoretical "
"computation FLOPs using UniKT's efficiency tool (`efficiency.py`), as "
"well as evaluating PyTorch 2.0+ `torch.compile` acceleration."

#: ../../source/evaluation/efficiency.md:5 499607bfd40c4584a8f52861da0b8c6d
msgid "目标与适用场景"
msgstr "Objectives & Use Cases"

#: ../../source/evaluation/efficiency.md:7 229b9f01d2c34afa93520efaa1172443
msgid "测量模型在实际推理场景下的端到端延迟（Mean、P50、P90、P99 分位数）与单秒吞吐量。"
msgstr ""
"Measuring end-to-end latency (Mean, P50, P90, P99 quantiles) and per-"
"second throughput under realistic inference scenarios."

#: ../../source/evaluation/efficiency.md:8 23e24643c2cf48c893f50f44b7c1a611
msgid "统计模型在不同批大小下的 GPU 显存峰值与显存溢出临界点。"
msgstr ""
"Profiling peak GPU memory footprints across various batch sizes and "
"identifying Out-of-Memory thresholds."

#: ../../source/evaluation/efficiency.md:9 bdc8f2dd5b924b689efd8e2fb0032599
msgid ""
"评估 `torch.compile`（`default`, `reduce-overhead`, `max-"
"autotune`）对知识追踪模型的加速比。"
msgstr ""
"Assessing speedup gains from `torch.compile` modes (`default`, `reduce-"
"overhead`, `max-autotune`) on knowledge tracing models."

#: ../../source/evaluation/efficiency.md:10 330a37dcd116462097bb51c03c2025c2
msgid "支持两种启动模式：**全新初始化快速评测**（无需等待训练）与**真实检查点评测**（完全继承实际训练参数）。"
msgstr ""
"Supports two launch modes: **Clean Initialization Fast Benchmarking** (no"
" prior training required) and **Trained Checkpoint Benchmarking** "
"(inherits exact training parameters)."

#: ../../source/evaluation/efficiency.md:12 6e6973c1c4334a48a9d00ce0de13d1b3
msgid "前置条件"
msgstr "Prerequisites"

#: ../../source/evaluation/efficiency.md:14 e5d0cd36698e497c8f9aa50cf047fe74
msgid "**环境准备**：建议在具有独立 GPU（CUDA）的环境下运行。CPU 环境同样支持，但 CUDA 相关的显存采样与动态图优化将被自适应跳过。"
msgstr ""
"**Environment**: Dedicated GPU (CUDA) recommended. CPU execution is "
"supported, with CUDA memory sampling and dynamic graph optimization "
"automatically bypassed."

#: ../../source/evaluation/efficiency.md:15 a94d876d74404d09b19ffba5cd0c58c8
msgid "**数据就绪**：评测会构建真实的数据批次以确保输入张量维度与实际训练评估完全一致，因此需要目标数据集已完成预处理。"
msgstr ""
"**Data Preparation**: The benchmark constructs real data batches to "
"ensure tensor dimensions match production training, requiring "
"preprocessed dataset files."

#: ../../source/evaluation/efficiency.md:17 dff27b1135f94cec8866d57123d7602e
msgid "评测模式与基本命令"
msgstr "Benchmark Modes and Basic Commands"

#: ../../source/evaluation/efficiency.md:19 fc2c1f6457544b9ea4af24b45bd22e61
msgid "模式一：全新初始化快速评测"
msgstr "Mode 1: Clean Initialization Fast Benchmark"

#: ../../source/evaluation/efficiency.md:21 4ac3e27f193f49f8a56e5f4a0e9c0e07
msgid ""
"如果你正在设计一个新模型架构，或者想要在短时间内比较多个模型的硬件资源消耗，可以直接使用 `-m` 和 `-d` "
"进行快速基准测试（模型采用随机权重初始化，无需提前训练）："
msgstr ""
"If designing a novel architecture or benchmarking relative resource "
"consumption across models, run fast benchmarks using `-m` and `-d` "
"(models initialize with random weights without training):"

#: ../../source/evaluation/efficiency.md:23 cb94901a7ee941329ffa0cc7bf019918
msgid "python efficiency.py -m GIKT -d assistments09\n"
msgstr "python efficiency.py -m GIKT -d assistments09\n"

#: ../../source/evaluation/efficiency.md:27 508dd97885b9417e9bbc109d784c97d2
msgid "若有单独导出的权重文件，可通过 `--efficiency.weights` 注入："
msgstr ""
"If a standalone exported weight file is available, inject it via "
"`--efficiency.weights`:"

#: ../../source/evaluation/efficiency.md:29 5f78f72296a949f1acff8db52a8ee5b5
msgid ""
"python efficiency.py -m SAKT -d assistments09 \\\n"
"  --efficiency.weights "
"runs/normal/SAKT_assistments09_20261109-120000_fold0_bs128/best_model.pth"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"python efficiency.py -m SAKT -d assistments09 \\\n"
"  --efficiency.weights "
"runs/normal/SAKT_assistments09_20261109-120000_fold0_bs128/best_model.pth"
"\n"

#: ../../source/evaluation/efficiency.md:34 c8bc008533724794a9eb560f05dd0ded
msgid "模式二：基于已训练检查点评测"
msgstr "Mode 2: Benchmark with Trained Checkpoint"

#: ../../source/evaluation/efficiency.md:36 410abbf4e4664258baafe971a29bb980
msgid ""
"若需要严格评测某个已完成实验的实际表现，使用 `--efficiency.run_dir` 参数。系统会自动读取该目录下的 "
"`run_config.yaml`，完全复现训练时的网络层数、嵌入维度及最大序列截断长度："
msgstr ""
"To evaluate exact performance from a completed experiment, supply "
"`--efficiency.run_dir`. The system automatically parses "
"`run_config.yaml`, replicating layer depths, embedding dimensions, and "
"sequence cutoff bounds:"

#: ../../source/evaluation/efficiency.md:38 48e664849f0e4841b6a2f27524ff2636
msgid ""
"python efficiency.py \\\n"
"  --efficiency.run_dir "
"runs/normal/GIKT_assistments09_20261109-120000_fold0_bs128\n"
msgstr ""
"python efficiency.py \\\n"
"  --efficiency.run_dir "
"runs/normal/GIKT_assistments09_20261109-120000_fold0_bs128\n"

#: ../../source/evaluation/efficiency.md:43 f89f7edf1c454960ab12e83bba9ffea6
msgid "进阶能效扫描"
msgstr "Advanced Efficiency Sweeps"

#: ../../source/evaluation/efficiency.md:45 5ada575a679d4496bf9816531337801d
msgid "`efficiency.py` 原生支持笛卡尔积交叉扫描，只需一条命令即可完成不同批大小与不同编译模式的系统化评测对比。"
msgstr ""
"`efficiency.py` natively supports Cartesian product sweeps, running "
"systematic comparisons across batch sizes and compilation modes in a "
"single command."

#: ../../source/evaluation/efficiency.md:47 6b899ac756df42579fc0ebe32826ed35
msgid "1. 扫描批大小"
msgstr "1\\. Batch Size Sweeps"

#: ../../source/evaluation/efficiency.md:49 4030203b3d9e4c89a7037e6dfaf8eaf2
msgid "对比批大小对显存增长与推理吞吐量的影响。每次批大小测试都会在隔离的子环境中重新初始化训练器，保证 CUDA 显存分配器干净："
msgstr ""
"Compare how batch sizes scale memory consumption and inference "
"throughput. Each batch size re-initializes trainers in isolation, "
"ensuring a clean CUDA memory allocator state:"

#: ../../source/evaluation/efficiency.md:51 dabede52d65a4dcbbeab174f01d91f03
msgid ""
"python efficiency.py -m SAKT -d assistments09 \\\n"
"  --efficiency.general.batch_sizes 32,64,128,256\n"
msgstr ""
"python efficiency.py -m SAKT -d assistments09 \\\n"
"  --efficiency.general.batch_sizes 32,64,128,256\n"

#: ../../source/evaluation/efficiency.md:56 660b55f5755c4657a0ee1b66f98b35d2
msgid "2. 评测 PyTorch 编译加速"
msgstr "2\\. Benchmark PyTorch Compilation Speedup"

#: ../../source/evaluation/efficiency.md:58 67be4a5c2b9f45ff8f81149a80270997
msgid "评测 PyTorch 2.0+ 编译技术带来的性能收益。系统将在同一硬件上对比基线（`off`，未编译）与不同编译模式下的推理耗时："
msgstr ""
"Measure performance gains from PyTorch 2.0+ compilation. The system "
"compares uncompiled baselines (`off`) against various compilation modes "
"on identical hardware:"

#: ../../source/evaluation/efficiency.md:60 b7967bb1bddb4b49a5e515df8c647124
msgid ""
"python efficiency.py -m SAKT -d assistments09 \\\n"
"  --efficiency.general.compile_modes off,default,reduce-overhead\n"
msgstr ""
"python efficiency.py -m SAKT -d assistments09 \\\n"
"  --efficiency.general.compile_modes off,default,reduce-overhead\n"

#: ../../source/evaluation/efficiency.md:65 8866177e49894c0496bcc0d64d538ba2
msgid "3. 组合交叉扫描"
msgstr "3\\. Combined Cross Sweeps"

#: ../../source/evaluation/efficiency.md:67 dd0827c95eed4605a25697985304a929
msgid "同时扫描批大小与编译模式，评估两者联合优化空间："
msgstr ""
"Simultaneously sweep batch sizes and compile modes to evaluate compound "
"optimization benefits:"

#: ../../source/evaluation/efficiency.md:69 8fe8786e92154a6a9f8090338d5b586b
msgid ""
"python efficiency.py -m SAKT -d assistments09 \\\n"
"  --efficiency.general.batch_sizes 32,64 \\\n"
"  --efficiency.general.compile_modes off,default\n"
msgstr ""
"python efficiency.py -m SAKT -d assistments09 \\\n"
"  --efficiency.general.batch_sizes 32,64 \\\n"
"  --efficiency.general.compile_modes off,default\n"

#: ../../source/evaluation/efficiency.md:75 3feb8856b96b4ac1932df92f5babc4c5
msgid "评测阶段与参数配置"
msgstr "Benchmark Phases & Configuration"

#: ../../source/evaluation/efficiency.md:77 86872287c64244afa2ea9c71ffdd7920
msgid "UniKT 能效评测系统由多个相互独立的评测阶段构成，默认全部执行。可以通过 `--efficiency.general.modes` 按需挑选："
msgstr ""
"UniKT efficiency benchmarking consists of multiple independent evaluation"
" phases, all executed by default. Select specific phases via "
"`--efficiency.general.modes`:"

#: ../../source/evaluation/efficiency.md:79 4e829120745d40649bef798a4b2dc49f
msgid ""
"# 仅执行推理延迟评测\n"
"python efficiency.py -m AKT -d assistments09 \\\n"
"  --efficiency.general.modes inference \\\n"
"  --efficiency.inference.iters 500\n"
msgstr ""
"# Execute inference latency benchmark only\n"
"python efficiency.py -m AKT -d assistments09 \\\n"
"  --efficiency.general.modes inference \\\n"
"  --efficiency.inference.iters 500\n"

